OL,3,AMicrosoft says services fully restored
OL,4,Aafter day-long global outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft apologised for the technical
OL,7,Fissue, which it said was introduced
OL,8,Fduring a "network capacity upgrade" and
OL,9,Fwas not caused by a cyber-attack or an
OL,10,Fartificial intelligence agent.
